Description: chloe runner components
 Shared parts of chloe: the transparent proxy (chloe-egress), Firecracker,
 the scripts and systemd units that run a workspace runner (microVM, proxy
 and DNS) in its own network namespace, the polkit rule that lets the chloe
 user manage runner units, and the chloe system user.
